lid went clink! Clank! Clink! Clank!","sentences":["Ananse tiptoed away with the hot pot on his head.","But the lid went clink!","Clank!","Clink!","Clank!"],"image":"sha256:06fa65e7098405ae85640cb70e6c2c606d9de602d0c01764101b20e31d142d87","alt":"The spider tiptoes down a path balancing a clay pot with a rattling lid.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:dcc657aa75ac6730e7025122bc07f697999ffdb46c4c3155028628bbfae81456","durationMs":9000,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3688],[3688,5826],[5826,7006],[7006,8186],[8186,9000]],"words":[[0,443],[443,959],[959,1254],[1254,1549],[1549,1770],[1770,1991],[1991,2212],[2212,2360],[2360,2581],[2581,3688],[3688,3909],[3909,4130],[4130,4351],[4351,4646],[4646,5826],[5826,7006],[7006,8186],[8186,9000]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"‘Shh, lid!’ whispered Ananse. He walked faster. Clink-clank! Clink-clank! The lid was very noisy.","sentences":["‘Shh, lid!’ whispered Ananse.","He walked faster.","Clink-clank!","Clink-clank!","The lid was very noisy."],"image":"sha256:462d5c9d0b826cba59f22d38e91b199932cc9f7603782c85dfc6a8dbb2eabdfc","alt":"The spider hurries down the forest path while the lid bounces on the pot.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:cda773e69fff2eeb0f89607cddfaec209d75765c3c2ca3a725722240fa2886ae","durationMs":10160,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3509],[3509,5337],[5337,6872],[6872,8407],[8407,10160]],"words":[[0,585],[585,1608],[1608,2266],[2266,3509],[3509,3655],[3655,4094],[4094,5337],[5337,6872],[6872,8407],[8407,8626],[8626,8845],[8845,9064],[9064,9356],[9356,10160]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Soon the smell and the noise reached the other animals. Tortoise came. Hen came. Little Antelope came. They followed Ananse into the forest.","sentences":["Soon the smell and the noise reached the other animals.","Tortoise came.","Hen came.","Little Antelope came.","They followed Ananse into the forest."],"image":"sha256:65797b66e735b50252b4146abd14dcd718a21c585132a8e51d1de6d96584b701","alt":"A tortoise, a hen and a young antelope follow the spider along the path.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:c2d5126d4d1f89bd356648abe47df92683e11d36cb670581e319b8b554518a90","durationMs":14120,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4851],[4851,6843],[6843,8402],[8402,10914],[10914,14120]],"words":[[0,347],[347,607],[607,1040],[1040,1300],[1300,1560],[1560,1993],[1993,2599],[2599,2859],[2859,3292],[3292,4851],[4851,5544],[5544,6843],[6843,7103],[7103,8402],[8402,8922],[8922,9615],[9615,10914],[10914,11261],[11261,11954],[11954,12474],[12474,12821],[12821,13081],[13081,14120]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Ananse sat down behind a rock and lifted the lid. ‘Uncle Ananse,’ said Little Antelope, ‘we are hungry too. Can we share?’","sentences":["Ananse sat down behind a rock and lifted the lid.","‘Uncle Ananse,’ said Little Antelope, ‘we are hungry too.","Can we share?’"],"image":"sha256:681ad0f235e2410e0a68838cc57dff5c8d86bcd43c096bede729733e3929fe11","alt":"The young antelope stands bravely in front of the spider and his pot, with the others behind.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:fbe2c9f9b43537a9936c8c4a22d7d346d1577eef33e3bb8d7f760e25a9f80b1f","durationMs":11200,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4359],[4359,9829],[9829,11200]],"words":[[0,513],[513,769],[769,1111],[1111,1624],[1624,1795],[1795,2137],[2137,2393],[2393,2906],[2906,3162],[3162,4359],[4359,4786],[4786,5726],[5726,6068],[6068,6581],[6581,7692],[7692,7863],[7863,8119],[8119,8632],[8632,9829],[9829,10085],[10085,10256],[10256,11200]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"Ananse looked at the pot. Then he looked at his hungry friends. He sighed and smiled. ‘Come and sit,’ he said.","sentences":["Ananse looked at the pot.","Then he looked at his hungry friends.","He sighed and smiled.","‘Come and sit,’ he said."],"image":"sha256:736867c7da0823033cbd67e59513fbffd33b3c5994d51855fca5b3d8b5ee1b35","alt":"The spider smiles, waving the animals t